{"head":"\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#071b45\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/brand/credmaispay-symbol.svg\">\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/brand/credmaispay-logo-transparent.png\">\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Organize, pague e acompanhe sua vida financeira em uma experiência simples.\">\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-image-preview:large\">\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://credmaispay.com/conta\">\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"CredMaisPay\">\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"pt_BR\">\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"CredMaisPay — crédito para quem trabalha e empreende\">\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sem banco, sem gerente, sem burocracia. Mais crédito, mais oportunidades e mais vendas.\">\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://credmaispay.com/conta\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://credmaispay.com/images/campaign-conta-v2.png\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"CredMaisPay: crédito, Pix e conta digital\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"CredMaisPay — crédito para quem trabalha e empreende\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Conta digital, Pix e microcrédito para sua rotina.\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://credmaispay.com/images/campaign-conta-v2.png\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Manrope:wght@500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <title>Conta digital | CredMaisPay</title>\n    \n    \n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin=\"\" href=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/assets/index-BTl9H9xn.css\">\n  ","body":"\n    <div id=\"root\"><div class=\"site-shell \"><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#conteudo\">Pular para o conteúdo</a><div class=\"scroll-progress\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"CredMaisPay, início\" translate=\"no\" href=\"/\" data-discover=\"true\"><img class=\"brand-wordmark\" src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/brand/credmaispay-wordmark.png.webp\" alt=\"CredMaisPay\" width=\"620\" height=\"166\" loading=\"eager\"></a><nav class=\"main-nav\" aria-label=\"Navegação principal\"><a class=\"\" href=\"/emprestimos\" data-discover=\"true\">Empréstimos</a><a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"active\" href=\"/conta\" data-discover=\"true\">Conta</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/seguranca\" data-discover=\"true\">Segurança</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/ajuda\" data-discover=\"true\">Ajuda</a><a class=\"\" href=\"/blog\" data-discover=\"true\">Blog</a><a class=\"mobile-access-link\" href=\"/login\" data-discover=\"true\">Acessar conta</a></nav><div class=\"header-actions\"><a class=\"text-link desktop-only\" href=\"/login\" data-discover=\"true\">Acessar</a><a class=\"button button-small\" href=\"/emprestimos#como-funciona\" data-discover=\"true\">Simular crédito <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-label=\"Abrir menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></header><main id=\"conteudo\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><section class=\"page-hero navy page-hero-account\" data-cm-hero=\"true\"><div class=\"page-hero-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow light\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><span></span> SUA CONTA, DO SEU JEITO</p><h1 data-cm-hero-title=\"true\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\">Sem gerente. <em>Sem burocracia.</em></h1><p data-cm-hero-text=\"true\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\">Resolva pelo celular e no seu tempo. Pague, receba e acompanhe o dinheiro do dia a dia, sem complicação.</p><div class=\"page-hero-actions\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><a class=\"button button-light\" href=\"/conta#comece\" data-discover=\"true\" data-cm-hero-button=\"true\">Abrir minha conta <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"page-hero-image\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/account-hero-relatable-v1.webp.webp\" alt=\"Pequena empreendedora conferindo o celular no balcão do próprio negócio\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" fetchpriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\"></div></section><section class=\"product-ribbon ribbon-blue\" aria-label=\"Destaques do produto\"><div class=\"product-ribbon-track\"><div class=\"product-ribbon-group\" aria-hidden=\"false\"><span>CredMaisPay</span><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Pix e pagamentos</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Visão da rotina</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Alertas úteis</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Controle no app</div></div><div class=\"product-ribbon-group\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>CredMaisPay</span><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Pix e pagamentos</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Visão da rotina</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Alertas úteis</div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Controle no app</div></div></div></section><section class=\"feature-intro \" data-cm-section=\"original-1\"><div class=\"feature-media \" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.0194691px);\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/account-feature-relatable-v1.webp.webp\" alt=\"Casal brasileiro descansando junto em casa, num momento tranquilo\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"eager\" data-cm-image=\"true\"><span>01</span></div><div class=\"feature-copy\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.189642px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow dark\"><span></span> VISÃO DO DIA</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Você abre. Você entende.</h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Saldo, compromissos e atalhos organizados para uma leitura rápida — sem fazer você procurar o que importa.</p><ul><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Saldo e movimentações no mesmo lugar</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Pix, pagamentos e comprovantes acessíveis</li></ul><a class=\"button button-dark\" href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\">Quero conhecer <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"section visual-feature-section\"><div class=\"visual-feature-grid\"><div class=\"visual-feature pix\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.0469176px);\"><div class=\"visual-feature-media\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/mockup-pix.png.webp\" alt=\"Celular exibindo pagamento por Pix\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"eager\"></div><div class=\"visual-feature-copy\"><span>01</span><h3>Pix do seu jeito</h3><p>Envie, receba e consulte cada movimento em poucos passos.</p><a aria-label=\"Conhecer Pix do seu jeito\" href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"visual-feature bills\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.162481px);\"><div class=\"visual-feature-media\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/mockup-contas.png.webp\" alt=\"Celular com contas pagas e comprovante digital\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"eager\"></div><div class=\"visual-feature-copy\"><span>02</span><h3>Contas organizadas</h3><p>Centralize pagamentos e mantenha os comprovantes sempre acessíveis.</p><a aria-label=\"Conhecer Contas organizadas\" href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"visual-feature alerts\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.420777px);\"><div class=\"visual-feature-media\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/mockup-alertas.png.webp\" alt=\"Celular mostrando alerta de Pix recebido\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"eager\"></div><div class=\"visual-feature-copy\"><span>03</span><h3>Alertas que ajudam</h3><p>Saiba quando o Pix chega e acompanhe movimentações importantes.</p><a aria-label=\"Conhecer Alertas que ajudam\" href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"visual-feature goals\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.927106px);\"><div class=\"visual-feature-media\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/mockup-metas.png.webp\" alt=\"Casal acompanhando objetivos financeiros pelo celular\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"eager\"></div><div class=\"visual-feature-copy\"><span>04</span><h3>Planos acompanhados</h3><p>Organize objetivos e compartilhe decisões com quem faz parte deles.</p><a aria-label=\"Conhecer Planos acompanhados\" href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"cofrinho-section\" id=\"cofrinho\" aria-labelledby=\"cofrinho-title\" data-cm-section=\"original-3\"><div class=\"cofrinho-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow light\"><span></span> COFRINHO CREDMAISPAY</p><h2 id=\"cofrinho-title\" data-cm-title=\"true\">Pequenas economias.<br><em>Grandes sonhos.</em></h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">A cada R$ 50 guardados no cofrinho, você concorre a sorteios mensais de R$ 1.000.</p><a class=\"button button-light\" href=\"/conta#comece\" data-discover=\"true\">Quero abrir minha conta <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"cofrinho-art\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 860px)\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/cofrinho-mascot-desktop-v2.webp.webp\" alt=\"Mascote azul CredMaisPay segurando uma moeda verde-limão\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"eager\" data-cm-image=\"true\"></picture></div><div class=\"cofrinho-details\"><div><span>GUARDE</span><strong>R$ 50</strong><p>A cada R$ 50 guardados, você concorre.</p></div><div><span>CONCORRA A</span><strong>R$ 1.000</strong><p>Sorteios mensais para quem guarda no cofrinho.</p></div><div class=\"cofrinho-date\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-days\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 18h.01\"></path></svg><p>Os sorteios acontecem todo dia 1 de cada mês.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"campaign-banner banner-navy \" data-cm-section=\"original-4\"><div class=\"campaign-photo\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.135343px);\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/account-family-campaign-v1.webp.webp\" alt=\"Cliente usando o celular em uma sala iluminada\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" loading=\"eager\" data-cm-image=\"true\"></div><div class=\"campaign-copy\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.135343px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow light\"><span></span> DINHEIRO NA VIDA REAL</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Sua rotina muda.<br>Sua conta acompanha.</h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Da casa ao trabalho, uma experiência construída para estar presente sem ocupar espaço demais.</p><a class=\"button button-light\" href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\">Conhecer a experiência<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"campaign-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C+</div></div></section><section class=\"section steps-section\" id=\"comece\" data-cm-section=\"original-5\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.135343px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow dark\"><span></span> PASSO A PASSO</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Da abertura ao primeiro movimento.</h2></div><div class=\"steps-list\"><div class=\"step-row\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.229074px);\"><b>01</b><h3>Conheça</h3><p>Veja os recursos e as condições disponíveis.</p><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"step-row\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.229074px);\"><b>02</b><h3>Cadastre</h3><p>Informe seus dados em um fluxo guiado.</p><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"step-row\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.229074px);\"><b>03</b><h3>Comece</h3><p>Acesse a experiência e organize sua rotina.</p><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div></div></section><section class=\"section app-split\" data-cm-section=\"original-6\"><div class=\"app-split-device\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.229074px);\"><img src=\"/admin/preview/assets/pay/images/produto-notebook.png.webp\" alt=\"Notebook exibindo a plataforma CredMaisPay\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"eager\" data-cm-image=\"true\"></div><div class=\"app-split-copy\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.314099px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow light\"><span></span> EXPERIÊNCIA DIGITAL</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">O essencial aparece primeiro.</h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Uma hierarquia visual que ajuda a ler sua vida financeira sem transformar tudo em planilha.</p><ul class=\"check-list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> atalhos para ações frequentes</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> histórico com leitura clara</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> visão dos próximos compromissos</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"info-band\" data-cm-section=\"original-7\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.483721px);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Clareza antes de confirmar.</h2><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Informações, condições e autorizações apresentadas no momento certo da jornada.</p><a href=\"/ajuda\" data-discover=\"true\">Saiba mais <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"section faq-section compact\" data-cm-section=\"original-8\"><div class=\"faq-intro\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.483721px);\"><p class=\"eyebrow dark\"><span></span> PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES</p><h2 data-cm-title=\"true\">Dúvidas sobre a conta</h2></div><div class=\"faq-support\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(2.29806px);\"><span class=\"faq-support-mark\">?</span><div><b>Ainda ficou com dúvida?</b><p data-cm-text=\"true\">Fale com a equipe e encontre o próximo passo para o seu momento.</p><a href=\"/ajuda#contato\" data-discover=\"true\">Falar com a equipe <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-list\"><details open=\"\"><summary><span>01</span>O que é a CredMaisPay?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p>A CredMaisPay reúne soluções financeiras digitais para pessoas físicas. A disponibilidade de cada produto será apresentada no momento da contratação.</p></details><details><summary><span>02</span>Como acompanho minha movimentação?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p>A proposta é concentrar saldo, pagamentos, Pix e notificações em uma única experiência digital.</p></details><details><summary><span>03</span>Quais recursos estarão disponíveis?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summar